{"type": "tool_call", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_uMtW7g1GsMLx1PaAQm9k7748", "requestId": "1eb0df6d-d785-4ea5-991a-943fd73d3869", "runId": "6edf8217-080", "seq": 102, "toolInput": "{\"question\":\"列出2025年1至4月各月销售额与净营收，缺月补0\",\"group_id\":\"wren-gap-live-20261006-233059\",\"sql\":\"WITH monthly AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month) AS mth, SUM(net_cents) AS net_cents, SUM(amount_cents) AS sales_cents, COUNT(*) AS order_cnt\\n  FROM order_net_revenue\\n  WHERE order_month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND order_month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n  GROUP BY 1\\n),\\ncal AS (\\n  SELECT DISTINCT DATE_TRUNC('month', month) AS mth FROM calendar_month\\n  WHERE month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n)\\nSELECT cal.mth AS 月份,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.sales_cents, 0) AS 销售额分,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.sales_cents, 0)/100.0 AS 销售额元,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.net_cents, 0) AS 净营收分,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.net_cents, 0)/100.0 AS 净营收元,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.order_cnt, 0) AS 有效订单数\\nFROM cal LEFT JOIN monthly ON cal.mth = monthly.mth\\nORDER BY cal.mth\"}"}
{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_uMtW7g1GsMLx1PaAQm9k7748", "requestId": "1eb0df6d-d785-4ea5-991a-943fd73d3869", "runId": "6edf8217-080", "seq": 103, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 列出2025年1至4月各月销售额与净营收，缺月补0\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nWITH monthly AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month) AS mth, SUM(net_cents) AS net_cents, SUM(amount_cents) AS sales_cents, COUNT(*) AS order_cnt\\n  FROM order_net_revenue\\n  WHERE order_month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND order_month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n  GROUP BY 1\\n),\\ncal AS (\\n  SELECT DISTINCT DATE_TRUNC('month', month) AS mth FROM calendar_month\\n  WHERE month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n)\\nSELECT cal.mth AS 月份,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.sales_cents, 0) AS 销售额分,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.sales_cents, 0)/100.0 AS 销售额元,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.net_cents, 0) AS 净营收分,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.net_cents, 0)/100.0 AS 净营收元,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.order_cnt, 0) AS 有效订单数\\nFROM cal LEFT JOIN monthly ON cal.mth = monthly.mth\\nORDER BY cal.mth\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| 月份 | 销售额分 | 销售额元 | 净营收分 | 净营收元 | 有效订单数 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n*(0 rows returned)*\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/0f70197bd3d8.csv（0 行 × 6 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/0f70197bd3d8.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
