{"type": "tool_call", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_sMdg0MqLEFxy4w5uL18f1715", "requestId": "1eb0df6d-d785-4ea5-991a-943fd73d3869", "runId": "63e0e4fc-f9f", "seq": 104, "toolInput": "{\"question\":\"按字符串月份左连接补齐1至4月\",\"group_id\":\"wren-gap-live-20261006-233059\",\"sql\":\"WITH monthly AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month) AS mth, SUM(net_cents) AS net_cents, SUM(amount_cents) AS sales_cents, COUNT(*) AS order_cnt\\n  FROM order_net_revenue\\n  WHERE order_month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND order_month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n  GROUP BY 1\\n)\\nSELECT CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) AS 日历月, CAST(monthly.mth AS VARCHAR) AS 订单月,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.sales_cents,0)/100.0 AS 销售额元, COALESCE(monthly.net_cents,0)/100.0 AS 净营收元, COALESCE(monthly.order_cnt,0) AS 有效订单数\\nFROM calendar_month cal\\nLEFT JOIN monthly ON CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) = SUBSTR(CAST(monthly.mth AS VARCHAR),1,7)\\nWHERE CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) >= '2025-01' AND CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) <= '2025-04'\\nORDER BY 日历月\"}"}
{"type": "tool_result", "toolName": "wren_run_sql", "toolCallId": "call_00_sMdg0MqLEFxy4w5uL18f1715", "requestId": "1eb0df6d-d785-4ea5-991a-943fd73d3869", "runId": "63e0e4fc-f9f", "seq": 105, "toolResult": "\"## wren 语义查询结果\\n\\n**知识库：** wren-gap-live-20261006-233059（group_id: `73b26360-df5c-497e-9137-bdfe7f50df67`）\\n\\n**查询问题：** 按字符串月份左连接补齐1至4月\\n\\n**SQL 语句：**\\n```sql\\nWITH monthly AS (\\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', order_month) AS mth, SUM(net_cents) AS net_cents, SUM(amount_cents) AS sales_cents, COUNT(*) AS order_cnt\\n  FROM order_net_revenue\\n  WHERE order_month >= DATE '2025-01-01' AND order_month < DATE '2025-05-01'\\n  GROUP BY 1\\n)\\nSELECT CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) AS 日历月, CAST(monthly.mth AS VARCHAR) AS 订单月,\\n       COALESCE(monthly.sales_cents,0)/100.0 AS 销售额元, COALESCE(monthly.net_cents,0)/100.0 AS 净营收元, COALESCE(monthly.order_cnt,0) AS 有效订单数\\nFROM calendar_month cal\\nLEFT JOIN monthly ON CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) = SUBSTR(CAST(monthly.mth AS VARCHAR),1,7)\\nWHERE CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) >= '2025-01' AND CAST(cal.month AS VARCHAR) <= '2025-04'\\nORDER BY 日历月\\n```\\n\\n**查询结果：**\\n\\n| 日历月 | 订单月 | 销售额元 | 净营收元 | 有效订单数 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| 2025-01 | 2025-01-01 | 300.0 | 230.0 | 2 |\\n| 2025-02 | 2025-02-01 | 700.0 | 670.0 | 2 |\\n| 2025-03 | NULL | 0.0 | 0.0 | 0 |\\n| 2025-04 | 2025-04-01 | 50.0 | 50.0 | 2 |\\n\\n**数据文件：** data/a5e96e1e37ac.csv（4 行 × 5 列；run_python 中 pd.read_csv('data/a5e96e1e37ac.csv') 读取）\\n\""}
